N5008 [expr.const], [expr.add]/4, [expr.post.incr], [expr.pre.incr]:
pointer arithmetic over a string literal in a constexpr function.
Non-vacuous: the last assertion is deliberately wrong and must FAIL.  Before
the fix: "static assertion failed: len" (len("abc") evaluated to 0) and
`++p; return *p' gave 'a'.
